# AgentAnycast Relay

Go relay server for the AgentAnycast P2P network. Provides Circuit Relay v2, AutoNAT signaling, and a skill registry for anycast discovery.

## Architecture

- Standalone Go binary, Docker-deployable
- Three core services: Circuit Relay v2, AutoNAT signaling, skill registry (gRPC)
- libp2p host with persistent Ed25519 identity
- Skill registry implements `registry_service.proto` from agentanycast-proto

## Directory Structure

```
cmd/
  relay/                 # Entry point
internal/
  relay/                 # Circuit Relay v2 wrapper with resource limits
  signaling/             # AutoNAT signaling service
  registry/              # Skill registry: register, unregister, discover, heartbeat
tests/                   # Integration tests
Dockerfile               # Production image
Dockerfile.integration   # Integration test image
docker-compose.yml       # Run with persistent key volume
```

## Common Patterns

### Skill registry RPCs

```go
// RegisterSkills — agent declares its skills
func (r *Registry) RegisterSkills(ctx context.Context, req *pb.RegisterSkillsRequest) (*pb.RegisterSkillsResponse, error)

// DiscoverBySkill — client finds agents by skill
func (r *Registry) DiscoverBySkill(ctx context.Context, req *pb.DiscoverBySkillRequest) (*pb.DiscoverBySkillResponse, error)

// Heartbeat — agent maintains registration
func (r *Registry) Heartbeat(ctx context.Context, req *pb.HeartbeatRequest) (*pb.HeartbeatResponse, error)
```

### Resource limit configuration

```go
relay.New(host,
    relay.WithResources(relay.Resources{
        MaxReservations: 128,
        MaxCircuits:     16,
        BufferSize:      4096,
    }),
)
```

## Code Style

- Go 1.25+
- Structured logging (Zap)
- Error wrapping: `fmt.Errorf("operation: %w", err)`
- Context propagation: always pass `context.Context` as first parameter

## Build & Test

```bash
go build -o agentanycast-relay ./cmd/relay
go test ./...
docker build -t agentanycast/relay .
docker compose up
```
